{"4200980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashen Seed", "steam_appid": 4200980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SURFACE BELONGS TO THEM.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras/32ff554369b782ffeb0995bec2ddbb9e.avif?t=1774069436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras_big/32ff554369b782ffeb0995bec2ddbb9e.webp?t=1774069436 width=1560 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is gone. The earth is poisoned. Your people burrow deeper, but there is nowhere left to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Rootkin—nameless, expendable, born to dig in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you have consumed something you should not have. Something that will not let you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ashen Seed</i> is a hand-drawn metroidvania of sacrifice and transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death Is Not the End</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fall. You return. The seed inside you does not forgive, does not release. Each death changes you in ways you do not yet understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras/c499c99aa134d0266ffdaa17ee6c368e.avif?t=1774069436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras_big/c499c99aa134d0266ffdaa17ee6c368e.webp?t=1774069436 width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight With Precision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No contact damage. No mercy. Only movement, spacing, and the heartbeat between you and what hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras/454ab8550117782a362fe45369c9ecf3.avif?t=1774069436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras_big/454ab8550117782a362fe45369c9ecf3.webp?t=1774069436 width=1560 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything Down Here Is Hungry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the only thing trying to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras/202bfc1816ffcc996b2cc92e9bf66d38.avif?t=1774069436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras_big/202bfc1816ffcc996b2cc92e9bf66d38.webp?t=1774069436 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend Through What Remains</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn depths. Collapsed sanctuaries. Forgotten places where something divine once breathed. Above, the surface waits—vast, cold, inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras/52870830680d1e20e622960ee3ec4521.avif?t=1774069436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras_big/52870830680d1e20e622960ee3ec4521.webp?t=1774069436 width=1560 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The old world is gone.</strong><br><strong>You carry what might replace it.</strong><br><strong>But the cost is one you cannot imagine.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SURFACE BELONGS TO THEM.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras/32ff554369b782ffeb0995bec2ddbb9e.avif?t=1774069436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras_big/32ff554369b782ffeb0995bec2ddbb9e.webp?t=1774069436 width=1560 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is gone. The earth is poisoned. Your people burrow deeper, but there is nowhere left to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Rootkin—nameless, expendable, born to dig in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you have consumed something you should not have. Something that will not let you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ashen Seed</i> is a hand-drawn metroidvania of sacrifice and transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death Is Not the End</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fall. You return. The seed inside you does not forgive, does not release. Each death changes you in ways you do not yet understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras/c499c99aa134d0266ffdaa17ee6c368e.avif?t=1774069436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras_big/c499c99aa134d0266ffdaa17ee6c368e.webp?t=1774069436 width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight With Precision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No contact damage. No mercy. Only movement, spacing, and the heartbeat between you and what hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras/454ab8550117782a362fe45369c9ecf3.avif?t=1774069436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras_big/454ab8550117782a362fe45369c9ecf3.webp?t=1774069436 width=1560 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything Down Here Is Hungry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the only thing trying to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras/202bfc1816ffcc996b2cc92e9bf66d38.avif?t=1774069436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras_big/202bfc1816ffcc996b2cc92e9bf66d38.webp?t=1774069436 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend Through What Remains</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn depths. Collapsed sanctuaries. Forgotten places where something divine once breathed. Above, the surface waits—vast, cold, inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras/52870830680d1e20e622960ee3ec4521.avif?t=1774069436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200980/extras_big/52870830680d1e20e622960ee3ec4521.webp?t=1774069436 width=1560 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The old world is gone.</strong><br><strong>You carry what might replace it.</strong><br><strong>But the cost is one you cannot imagine.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A dark, hand-drawn metroidvania of ecological horror. You are a disposable miner in a dying world, burdened with a mysterious power. Navigate the suffocating depths, survive against colossal threats from the surface, and discover what grows from ash and sacrifice.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A Latin America